{
  "title": "SET-ANUBIS: a modular pipeline for ANUBIS long-lived particle sensitivity studies",
  "description": "SET-ANUBIS is a modular Python/C++ framework for long-lived-particle sensitivity studies in the proposed ANUBIS detector. It connects UFO model handling, decay-property calculations, event-generation inputs, HepMC ingestion, ATLAS-cavern/ANUBIS geometry, truth-level selection and reproducible provenance.",
